      'In addition to professors and students, the ceremony was attended by many guests, representatives of state institutions, cultural institutions, rectors from 28 different universities, ambassadors of many countries, including ambassadors and representatives of countries that have not yet have recognized Kosovo, such as the Russian Federation, Azerbaijan, Belarus, Ukraine, China, Romania, Georgia, etc .',
