      'Lulzim Tafa in his speech to the audience said that this is an honor for him, and for literature and its values: “Thank you for believing in these values, I will never forget such a beautiful moment, and you will always be in my heart, I am inspired by the youth, the generation of Technology. Technology has shrinked the world in size and thus increased the chances of people getting to know each other better, getting to know each other’s literature and culture. There are also increased chances to work together for the benefit of mankind, such as the advancement of human rights, freedom and democracy, animal rights and the environment” said Rector Tafa.',
